[{"code":"not_implemented","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":46,"col":10},"end":{"line":46,"col":21}},"title":"NOT IMPLEMENTED YET","message":"A limit of the compiler: this program's subscription at Push.beni:21:29 starts\nwith a function made inside a function of the module `Push`. The compiler can\ncall, from the program's mount, a function written in place in the module that\ncalls the program's constructor or a top-level function that a module exports;\nit lowers one module at a time, so it cannot write a closure of another module\nthere (`docs/design/browser-inline.md` §5, class 4). Until it can, write the\nstart as a `pub` top-level function of its module."}]
